			"notes": "## Added\n- Autocrafting/Request now available (It needs more test and work but should be functional, I'm not responsible of dupes or losses).\n\n## Fixed\n- UI/UX re-design broke manager settings, you can now save your settings.\n- UI getting clamp in higher monitors and higher GUI Scaling (I hope its the last time).\n- Some [config](https://github.com/BgameXL/Gregtech-Terminals/blob/main/src/main/java/com/gtceuterminal/common/config/ItemsConfig.java) values were not being applied correctly.\n- Highlight got fixed, that's it.\n\n## Changed\n- Better UI Design (This thing got re-re-design again).\n- Mod now gets called \"Gregtech Terminals\" modid stays the same.\n\n## Notes\nMore difficult than expected, but I've been making progress. The next update will change how the Schematic Interface behaves. It will now work more like a \"Building Gadget,\" allowing you to build lines. Every player's dream: automation, including copy-and-paste functionality. \nPlease report any bugs specific to these projects here so we can continue to support them. If you would like your project to be integrated feel free to leave a suggestion [here](https://github.com/BgameXL/GTCEu-Terminals/issues) on GitHub or contact us on [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/r7PeUvMytZ).\n\nAutocrafting: \n<img width=\"1904\" height=\"1154\" alt=\"2026-06-18_17 41 44\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5068b4d0-92d4-4e26-85b8-2c7174f0d508\" />"
