			"notes": "## Added\n\n- Adding a Custom Theme for the Modpack \"[TerraFirmaGreg](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmagreg-modern)\". This theme is not finished currently in beta phase.\n- Added Blacklist for both Dismantler and Schematic Interface. (Check .minecraft/config/gtceuterminals.yaml).\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Regex fixed, Now able to detect custom Multiblocks.\n- Fixed a preview issue in the version 1.6.4.\n- More Client-server issues.\n\n## Changed\n\n- No changes. Nope.\n\n## Notes\n\nThe custom theme for TFG is just an experimental work. If you like what you see don't forget to join and discuss in discord.\nPlease report any bugs specific to these projects here so we can continue to support them. If you would like your project to be integrated feel free to leave a suggestion [here](https://github.com/BgameXL/GTCEu-Terminals/issues) on GitHub or contact us on [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/r7PeUvMytZ).\n\n### Images\n\n<img width=\"1209\" height=\"976\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88dd5bbb-b54b-48cc-822b-3369e915089b\" />\n\n<img width=\"1230\" height=\"296\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f073e00-61d9-42af-98bf-b279555ec404\" />\n\n<img width=\"1210\" height=\"983\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad194435-8b54-4be2-9764-197824385ac2\" />"
